Server init.

>> message := ['this is a string to be encrypted!'].
>> key := ['secret123!'].
>> vault := ସିନ୍ଦୁକ ନୂତନ: ['myvault'].

>> encrypted := vault ଏନକ୍ରିପ୍ଟ: message ଚାବି: key.
>> decrypted := vault ଡିକ୍ରିପ୍ଟ: encrypted ଚାବି: key.

ଆଉଟପୁଟ୍ 
ଲେଖ: ['Message:'], ନୂଆ-ଧାଡ଼ି
ଲେଖ: message, ନୂଆ-ଧାଡ଼ି
ଲେଖ: ['Decrypted:'], ନୂଆ-ଧାଡ଼ି
ଲେଖ: decrypted, ନୂଆ-ଧାଡ଼ି.
